rse (per map note); modeled here as a generic 1-unit Area 5C slot. Electives: any courses numbered 100-499 (see a counselor). AA/AS requirements: 60 degree-applicable units with 2.0 GPA, 12 units within Los Rios, each required course 'C' or better, Cal-GETC Areas 1-6 with 'C' or better. Bachelor's-degree holders are deemed to have satisfied GE/graduation competency (per map). Political Science, People & Society Meta Majors. tccns mirrors SCC local course codes (California community colleges do not use TCCNS).",
